{"id":"b0fdff2d00a515f5","group":"58","path":"58/batch03/58-df-zfc-branch-through-iteration-tree.md","title":"ZFC Branch Through Iteration Tree","display":"df-zfc-branch-through-iteration-tree — ZFC Branch Through Iteration Tree","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-branch-through-iteration-tree","aliases":["58-df-zfc-branch-through-iteration-tree"],"display":"df-zfc-branch-through-iteration-tree — ZFC Branch Through Iteration Tree","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[58-df-zfc-iteration-tree]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-branch-through-iteration-tree"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-branch-through-iteration-tree</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-branch-through-iteration-tree — ZFC Branch Through Iteration Tree"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"92fbda0605a6cb98\" href=\"?note=92fbda0605a6cb98\" title=\"58-df-zfc-iteration-tree\">58-df-zfc-iteration-tree</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T,M,\\theta,R,\\vec M,\\vec E,\\vec i\\in V\">\\(\\mathcal T,M,\\theta,R,\\vec M,\\vec E,\\vec i\\in V\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\subseteq\\theta\">\\(b\\subseteq\\theta\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> is the metasyntactic predicate from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"92fbda0605a6cb98\" href=\"?note=92fbda0605a6cb98\" title=\"58-df-zfc-iteration-tree\">58-df-zfc-iteration-tree</a></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BranchThroughIterationTree}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{BranchThroughIterationTree}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> is therefore also metasyntactic</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}branch\\text{-}through\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}tree}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}{}&amp;\\mathrm{BranchThroughIterationTree}_S(b,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow\\exists M,\\theta,R,\\vec M,\\vec E,\\vec i\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathcal T=\\langle\\theta,R,\\vec M,\\vec E,\\vec i\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,M,\\theta)\\\\&amp;\\land b\\subseteq\\theta\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in\\theta\\;\\exists\\beta\\in b\\;(\\gamma\\in\\beta\\lor\\gamma=\\beta)\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in b\\;(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in R\\lor\\langle\\beta,\\alpha\\rangle\\in R)\\land\\forall\\beta\\in b\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\theta\\;(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in R\\to\\alpha\\in b)\\Bigr).\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}branch\\text{-}through\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}tree}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}{}&amp;\\mathrm{BranchThroughIterationTree}_S(b,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow\\exists M,\\theta,R,\\vec M,\\vec E,\\vec i\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathcal T=\\langle\\theta,R,\\vec M,\\vec E,\\vec i\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,M,\\theta)\\\\&amp;\\land b\\subseteq\\theta\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in\\theta\\;\\exists\\beta\\in b\\;(\\gamma\\in\\beta\\lor\\gamma=\\beta)\\\\&amp;\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in b\\;(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in R\\lor\\langle\\beta,\\alpha\\rangle\\in R)\\land\\forall\\beta\\in b\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\theta\\;(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in R\\to\\alpha\\in b)\\Bigr).\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A branch is cofinal in the tree length, linearly ordered by the iteration-tree order, and downward closed in that order; ordinal clubness is not substituted for tree cofinality.</li>\n<li>The tree order is now unpacked from the same iteration-tree code. Cofinality is expressed by an explicit <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\forall\\gamma&lt;\\theta\">\\(\\forall\\gamma&lt;\\theta\\)</span> clause, which also handles successor-length trees correctly; the former equation <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sup b=\\theta\">\\(\\sup b=\\theta\\)</span> did not.</li>\n<li>Because the source iteration-tree predicate currently contains a metatheoretic extender-ultrapower clause, this consumer inherits the same status even though its branch conditions are set-theoretic.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-iteration-tree","status":"resolved","id":"92fbda0605a6cb98","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-iteration-tree]]","embed":false},{"target":"58-df-zfc-iteration-tree","status":"resolved","id":"92fbda0605a6cb98","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ is the metasyntactic predicate from [[58-df-zfc-iteration-tree]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal T,M,\\theta,R,\\vec M,\\vec E,\\vec i\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"b\\subseteq\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BranchThroughIterationTree}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\begin{aligned}\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}branch\\text{-}through\\text{-}iteration\\text{-}tree}\\vdash_{\\mathsf{meta}}{}&\\mathrm{BranchThroughIterationTree}_S(b,\\mathcal T)\\leftrightarrow\\exists M,\\theta,R,\\vec M,\\vec E,\\vec i\\in V\\;\\Bigl(\\mathcal T=\\langle\\theta,R,\\vec M,\\vec E,\\vec i\\rangle\\land\\mathrm{IterationTree}_S(\\mathcal T,M,\\theta)\\\\&\\land b\\subseteq\\theta\\land\\forall\\gamma\\in\\theta\\;\\exists\\beta\\in b\\;(\\gamma\\in\\beta\\lor\\gamma=\\beta)\\\\&\\land\\forall\\alpha,\\beta\\in b\\;(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in R\\lor\\langle\\beta,\\alpha\\rangle\\in R)\\land\\forall\\beta\\in b\\;\\forall\\alpha\\in\\theta\\;(\\langle\\alpha,\\beta\\rangle\\in R\\to\\alpha\\in b)\\Bigr).\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"\\forall\\gamma<\\theta","display":false},{"tex":"\\sup b=\\theta","display":false}],"bytes":2011,"backlinks":[{"id":"0134626c9734e3cd","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathrm{BranchThroughIterationTree}_S$ (branch predicate, see [[../batch03/58-df-zfc-branch-through-iteration-tree.md]])"},{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-121","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[58-df-zfc-branch-through-iteration-tree]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-1473","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch03/58-df-zfc-branch-through-iteration-tree.md|58-df-zfc-branch-through-iteration-tree]]（batch03）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","92fbda0605a6cb98"]}